sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant US as Upload Service
    participant S3 as Object Storage
    participant Q as Transcoding Queue
    participant TW as Transcoding Worker
    participant MS as Metadata Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U, DB: Video Upload Flow

    U->>API: POST /videos/upload/init
    API->>US: Initialize upload
    US->>DB: Create video record (status: uploading)
    US->>S3: Create multipart upload
    US-->>U: upload_id, presigned chunk URLs

    loop Upload chunks in parallel
        U->>S3: PUT chunk with presigned URL
        S3-->>U: ETag confirmation
    end

    U->>API: POST /videos/upload/complete
    API->>US: Complete upload
    US->>S3: Complete multipart upload
    US->>DB: Update status: processing
    US->>Q: Enqueue transcoding job
    US-->>U: video_id, status: processing

    Note over Q, S3: Transcoding Pipeline

    Q->>TW: Dequeue transcoding job
    TW->>S3: Download raw video
    
    par Parallel Transcoding
        TW->>TW: Transcode to 144p
        TW->>TW: Transcode to 360p
        TW->>TW: Transcode to 720p
        TW->>TW: Transcode to 1080p
    end
    
    TW->>S3: Upload all quality versions
    TW->>TW: Generate thumbnails
    TW->>S3: Upload thumbnails
    TW->>MS: Update video metadata
    MS->>DB: Update status: ready, add quality URLs

    Note over U, S3: Video Streaming Flow

    U->>API: GET /videos/{id}/manifest.m3u8
    API->>MS: Get video qualities
    MS->>DB: Query video_qualities
    MS-->>API: Quality URLs
    API-->>U: HLS manifest

    loop Streaming segments
        U->>S3: GET segment via CDN
        Note right of S3: CDN caches segments
        S3-->>U: Video segment
    end

    U->>API: POST /analytics/event (async)
    API->>Q: Queue analytics event
